# Unit Tests Required

Every new backend/frontend logic change includes unit tests.

1. Cover happy path **and** error handling / input validation
2. Aim for agreed coverage on changed code (team default: >80% on changed lines)
3. Follow the `tdd` skill when implementing features or fixes
4. Existing automated regression tests in the pipeline must stay green before merge
